<title>FINLAND: A.AHLSTROM JAN-AUG NET PROFIT FIM 151 MLN.</title>
<headline>A.AHLSTROM JAN-AUG NET PROFIT FIM 151 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to August 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit					 151.1 vs 217.6</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax   326.8 vs 299.0</p>
<p> Net sales					7,347.0 vs 7,254.5</p>
<p> Operating profit				 621.9 vs 523.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish privately-owned paper and</p>
<p>engineering company is A.Ahlstrom Oy.</p>
